          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-2">Reactive State</h3>
        <p class="text-white/35 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <code class="text-violet-400 font-mono">{{ "{{ expr }}" }}</code> <code class="text-violet-400 font-mono">@click</code> <code class="text-violet-400 font-mono">:if</code> <code class="text-violet-400 font-mono">:each</code> — Proxy tabanlı reaktif UI, JS bilmeden.
        </p>
